  "instructions": "Boil potatoes and peas. Mash them slightly.\nHeat a pan. Dry sauté mustard seeds and cumin seeds.\nAdd green chilies and turmeric powder. Add mashed potato and peas too. Add salt (if using) and lemon juice.\nCook for a few minutes. Turn off the flame and set aside.\nMake a sandwich with Peas Potato Masala between two slices of Ezekiel 4:9 bread. Grill both sides in a sandwich maker or a non-stick griddle till golden.",
